OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister says Budget not
OL,4,Aserious about Wales ahead of meeting
OL,5,Awith PM
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham's first Budget was "not
OL,8,Fserious about Wales", the country's
OL,9,Ffirst minister has said hours before
OL,10,Fhis meeting with the prime minister.
OL,12,FRhun ap Iorwerth joined Scottish First
OL,13,FMinister John Swinney in Glasgow on
OL,14,FFriday for a National Economic Council
OL,15,Fmeeting.
OL,17,FThe Welsh first minister said
OL,18,FChancellor John Healey's funding
OL,19,Fpackage offered "paltry" sums for rail
OL,20,Fand cuts for Welsh public services.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
